  DisplayName: Greater Field Discovery (Toxicologist)
  IconPath: icons/commodities/bones/skull-hollow-white.webp
  Description: When a creature fails its initial saving throw against an infused
    injury poison you created, the wound sprays poison onto another creature adjacent
    to it. The attacker who caused the injury chooses which creature, if there's
    more than one, and can choose to forgo this effect. That creature is exposed
    to the poison. The second creature doesn't spread the poison further.
